+accepting pairing, reconciliation, or usage data; a valid non-success response is rejected as an
+`Error` carrying its HTTP status and validated snake_case server error code. Invalid, oversized,
+malformed, non-JSON, or terminal-control-containing responses remain `invalid_server_response`.
